ion below, expressing your answer in the form $a+b\\text{i},$ where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.\n\n$\\frac{4}{-2-3\\text{i}}=($\n{{field-1}} \n$)\\,+\\,($\n{{field-2}}\n$)\\,\\text{i}$" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275639 1113 #uuid "bc900cb3-472d-557f-9d66-56f5a84c0c6d" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275639 1145 "The denominator is $-2-3\\text{i}$ and its conjugate is $-2+3\\text{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-2+3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{-2-3\\text{i}} & =\\frac{4}{-2-3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-2+3\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4(-2+3\\text{i})}{(-2)^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8+12\\text{i}}{4-(-9)} \\\\  & =\\frac{-8+12\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{-8+12\\text{i}}{13}=(-\\frac{8}{13})+(\\frac{12}{13})\\,\\text{i}\n$$" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275640 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275641 13194139533979 true] [17592186275640 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533979 true] [17592186275640 1041 "field-1" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275640 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275641 13194139533979 true] [17592186275640 1110 #uuid "58546355-f26b-59a5-a14e-203f6070847d" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275641 1034 "-\\frac{8}{13}" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275641 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533979 true] [17592186275641 1111 #uuid "5732facb-3c7a-5316-aefe-6363f85e922d" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275642 1000 #edb/ref 17592186275643 13194139533979 true] [17592186275642 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533979 true] [17592186275642 1041 "field-2" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275642 1104 #edb/ref 17592186275643 13194139533979 true] [17592186275642 1110 #uuid "874f22ee-26ac-519f-9d50-048764065442" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275643 1034 "\\frac{12}{13}" 13194139533979 true] [17592186275643 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 131941395339